Description: Fall back to the interpreter ABI for legacy stable-ABI requests on FT
 Stable ABI for free-threaded Python starts at 3.15. Legacy requests must
 produce interpreter-specific modules, including generated and composite
 bindings. Preserve newer abi3t requests and all GIL safety declarations.
Author: StableKite
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-17

